From 27fb5fcc4a695918ae75f6cb852a1e1439dae1f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: axon7-build <axon7-build@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:15:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 29/29] axon7: configfs USB gadget for the 4.4 kernel
 (android_usb is gone)

The 3.18 init.qcom.usb.rc wrote /sys/class/android_usb/android0, which the
4.4 kernel does not have: adbd ran, sys.usb.state said adb, the PC saw no
device. Build the configfs gadget g1 and set the product IDs here;
init.usb.configfs.rc links the functions and binds 6a00000.dwc3.

Change-Id: Ia9338f00ed577c86be32dafbdafc650fd46e6fc7
---
 init/init.qcom.usb.rc | 388 ++++++------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 56 insertions(+), 332 deletions(-)

